IAI-SLE2

BFS vs DFS on the 8-Puzzle A Python profiling project that compares two uninformed search algorithms, Breadth-First Search and Depth-First Search, by solving the same 8-puzzle and measuring their real performance.

Features
Solves the 8-puzzle using Breadth-First Search (BFS)
Solves the same 8-puzzle using Depth-First Search (DFS)
Counts nodes expanded by each algorithm
Times each algorithm using time.perf_counter()
Averages the timing over 3 runs
Prints a clean results summary to the console
Technologies Used
Python 3
collections.deque
time.perf_counter()
Tuples for state representation
while loops and functions
